er></xbrli:entity><xbrli:period><xbrli:startDate>2026-10-14</xbrli:startDate><xbrli:endDate>2026-10-14</xbrli:endDate></xbrli:period><xbrli:scenario><xbrldi:typedMember dimension="in-capmkt:ChangeInManagementAxis"><in-capmkt:ChangeInManagementDomain>ChangeInManagementDomain1</in-capmkt:ChangeInManagementDomain></xbrldi:typedMember></xbrli:scenario></xbrli:context><xbrli:unit id="pure"><xbrli:measure>xbrli:pure</xbrli:measure></xbrli:unit><in-capmkt:NSESymbol contextRef="MainI">HDBFS</in-capmkt:NSESymbol><in-capmkt:NameOfTheCompany contextRef="MainI">HDB Financial Services Limited</in-capmkt:NameOfTheCompany><in-capmkt:ScripCode contextRef="MainI">544429</in-capmkt:ScripCode><in-capmkt:MSEISymbol contextRef="MainI">NOTLISTED</in-capmkt:MSEISymbol><in-capmkt:ISIN contextRef="MainI">INE756I01012</in-capmkt:ISIN><in-capmkt:WhetherDisclosureFiledForListedEntity contextRef="MainD">true</in-capmkt:WhetherDisclosureFiledForListedEntity><in-capmkt:RelationshipWithTheListedEntity contextRef="MainD">Listed Entity (self)</in-capmkt:RelationshipWithTheListedEntity><in-capmkt:WhetherEventOrInformationIsAnOutcomeOfBoardMeeting contextRef="MainD">false</in-capmkt:WhetherEventOrInformationIsAnOutcomeOfBoardMeeting><in-capmkt:DateOfOccurrenceOfEventOrInformation contextRef="MainD">2026-10-14</in-capmkt:DateOfOccurrenceOfEventOrInformation><in-capmkt:TimeOfOccurrenceOfEventOrInformation contextRef="MainD">15:45:00</in-capmkt:TimeOfOccurrenceOfEventOrInformation><in-capmkt:NumberOfPersonsOrEntitiesForWhomChangeIsBeingReported contextRef="MainI" unitRef="pure" decimals="0">1</in-capmkt:NumberOfPersonsOrEntitiesForWhomChangeIsBeingReported><in-capmkt:DateOfReport contextRef="MainI">2026-10-14</in-capmkt:DateOfReport><in-capmkt:TypeOfChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Appointment</in-capmkt:TypeOfChange><in-capmkt:CategoryForChange contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Key Managerial Personnel</in-capmkt:CategoryForChange><in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Company Secretary and Compliance Officer</in-capmkt:DesignationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Mr.</in-capmkt:SalutationOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">Vinod Koyande</in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement1">2026-10-31</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:BriefProfile contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement1">Mr. Vinod Koyande is a qualified Company Secretary, Law Graduate (LL.B.) and Master of Commerce (M.Com.), with over 15 years of professional experience in corporate governance, regulatory compliance, capital markets, Board advisory and secretarial functions across leading listed organisations. He is currently associated with HDB Financial Services Limited as Deputy Company Secretary, where he has played a pivotal role in the Company’s Initial Public Offering (IPO) and strengthening the post-listing governance and regulatory compliance framework. Previously, he served as Company Secretary of SBI Life Insurance Company Limited for over five years, overseeing corporate governance, Board and Committee affairs, and regulatory compliance. He has also held key positions with BSE Limited and ICICI Lombard General Insurance Company Limited.

His core expertise encompasses Board and Committee governance, SEBI LODR Regulations, Companies Act, RBI and IRDAI regulatory frameworks, IPO execution, insider trading compliance, ESOP administration and investor relations. His experience with BSE Limited has provided him with a strong understanding of capital market regulations, listing compliance and regulatory enforcement. His diverse industry exposure and extensive regulatory expertise enable him to effectively manage complex governance matters and contribute to the Company’s governance standards and strategic objectives.</in-capmkt:BriefProfile></xbrli:xbrl>
